# Owner decision 2026-11-15: pinyin typed and not confirmed is dropped when the user leaves the composition (a click
# outside or inside the same field, Tab moving the focus, another app, the window closing): nothing of it stays in the
# field, no marked text is left, the panel is hidden. Contract v1.3: the pinyin was only ever in the panel's input
# line, so on every profile (Chromium commits marked text on blur) there is nothing in the field to commit.
NAME closing the window drops unconfirmed pinyin
PROFILES all
LANG chinese
TEXT "Hi |"
TYPE nihao
EXPECT marked none
EXPECT preedit "ni hao"
FOCUS closewindow
EXPECT doc "Hi "
EXPECT marked none
EXPECT preedit none
EXPECT panel hidden
